 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Tell the time",
   "texto": [
    "**Saat kaç?** = what time is it? **Saat üç** is used for the hour in point (three o'clock). To say «on three.», add **-te/-ta**: **Saat üçte**.",
    "**Saat yedide** = at seven; **Saat dokuzda** = at nine. The locative suffix fits the last vocal and consonant.",
    "**Önce** means «before» and **sonra**, «after»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Days of the week",
   "texto": [
    "The days are not written with capital: **pazartesi, salı, çarşamba, perşembe, cuma, cumartesi, pazar**.",
    "**Pazartesi günü** = Monday (literally Monday). **Hafta sonu** means «weekend»."
   ]
  },
